00:11:12,128 --> 00:11:15,350
down twenty-eight percent from twenty thousand,

295
00:11:15,350 --> 00:11:17,064
six hundred thirty-three.

296
00:11:17,244 --> 00:11:18,706
In our calculation,

297
00:11:18,706 --> 00:11:21,554
its share fell from about nine tenths

