00:11:39,647 --> 00:11:42,283
Everything so far used nine months.

307
00:11:42,463 --> 00:11:44,686
But the most recent three months,

308
00:11:44,686 --> 00:11:46,235
July through September,

309
00:11:46,235 --> 00:11:47,246
look different.

310
00:11:47,426 --> 00:11:50,650
Ford's F-Series, not counting the Lightning,

311
00:11:50,650 --> 00:11:52,995
sold two hundred three thousand,

312
00:11:52,995 --> 00:11:55,120
four hundred eighteen trucks,

