00:11:59,843 --> 00:12:00,852
In that quarter,

316
00:12:00,852 --> 00:12:03,123
the biggest brand in the country was

317
00:12:03,123 --> 00:12:03,628
growing.

318
00:12:03,978 --> 00:12:05,673
And Ford was not alone.

319
00:12:05,853 --> 00:12:08,769
The Chevrolet Silverado grew four point nine

320
00:12:08,769 --> 00:12:10,293
percent in the quarter,

321
00:12:10,293 --> 00:12:12,613
to one hundred forty-four thousand,

322
00:12:12,613 --> 00:12:14,270
four hundred ninety-nine.

323
00:12:14,450 --> 00:12:17,228
The Ford Ranger grew fourteen point eight

324
00:12:17,228 --> 00:12:17,770
percent.

